-- Hovering a hole shows its GOAL — the same judgement the diagnostic
-- at that span carries, without the report's framing, since the label
-- is the token under the cursor and the location is where you are.
--
-- A clausal def is an ITEM MACRO, so one written hole is elaborated
-- once per generated item — the eliminator body, the clause's equation
-- lemma, the uniqueness lemma — each at its own context. All three
-- show: reading them is fine, it is rewriting that needs one answer.
def dbl : ℕ → ℕ
  | dbl Z ≔ Z
  | dbl (S n) ≔ ?st
